                "id": "ambitious-teams",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "Not everything I build starts with a client. Quite often it starts with a question that refuses to leave me alone. Recently that’s included redesigning the iOS keyboard, exploring better ways for people to understand AI, thinking about trust in digital products, and experimenting with robotics and creative engineering."
              },
              {
                "id": "unfinished-projects",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "Some of these projects become something I can share. Others stay as sketches, prototypes or half-answered questions. They still shape how I approach whatever comes next."
